post_upgrade() {
    cat <<'MSG'
This package no longer self-installs a copy into ~/Applications. If you ran an
earlier version, these leftovers from the old behaviour may remain and can be
removed by hand:
    ~/Applications/KyberLinuxPort-x86_64.AppImage
    ~/Applications/KyberLinuxPort.extracted/
    ~/.local/share/applications/kyber-linuxport*.desktop
    ~/.local/share/applications/kyber-bf2.desktop
The launcher now lives in /opt and is managed by pacman. It registers its
qrc:// and nxm:// handlers itself on every start.
MSG
}
